      "article_id": "a1_e55500e91a5c1fe358a77e59",
      "headline": "US launches 'heavy' strikes on Iran after attempted attack on American troops",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "US launches 'heavy' strikes on Iran after attempted attack on American troops - Published The US military says it has completed a \"heavy wave\" of strikes against Iran in retaliation for Tuesday's attempted ballistic missile attacks on American forces.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-31T08:03:13.958349+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "cf737f4f2dc114043f3f0bb257a119e3c88d5d9a2b9eef7408d7020bfe26633a",
          "excerpt": "US launches 'heavy' strikes on Iran after attempted attack on American troops - Published The US military says it has completed a \"heavy wave\" of strikes against Iran in retaliation for Tuesday's attempted ballistic missile attacks on American forces.",
          "sentence_hash": "90cf22e00133f920e637d7e26cf3f608ac5b503a4e8f8264c06ebf2e485091e6",
          "anchors": [
            "for",
            "all",
            "et"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "Centcom said it hit \"dozens\" of Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC) targets in response to Iran's firing on US bases in Jordan and at ships in the Strait of Hormuz.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-31T08:03:13.958393+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "cf737f4f2dc114043f3f0bb257a119e3c88d5d9a2b9eef7408d7020bfe26633a",
          "excerpt": "Centcom said it hit \"dozens\" of Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC) targets in response to Iran's firing on US bases in Jordan and at ships in the Strait of Hormuz.",
          "sentence_hash": "189f18a58e8c7d09ef7b8670cc8ccfb5048e9d866382c152e07bee27efef28ef",
          "anchors": [
            "et"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "The latest hostilities come on a week that has seen the conflict expand, with the first publicly announced joint US-Saudi strikes targeting Iranian proxies in Iraq.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-31T08:03:13.958436+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "cf737f4f2dc114043f3f0bb257a119e3c88d5d9a2b9eef7408d7020bfe26633a",
          "excerpt": "The latest hostilities come on a week that has seen the conflict expand, with the first publicly announced joint US-Saudi strikes targeting Iranian proxies in Iraq.",
          "sentence_hash": "ed0b4f87516dd00d3c4765f4cbbef1dbeb75ba9fe82c2bc864dddb3c9c852fb5",
          "anchors": [
            "et"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "Iran and the US have engaged in escalating strikes and counter-strikes since a ceasefire in April, aimed at pausing the months-long war, fell apart in June.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-31T08:03:13.958466+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "cf737f4f2dc114043f3f0bb257a119e3c88d5d9a2b9eef7408d7020bfe26633a",
          "excerpt": "Iran and the US have engaged in escalating strikes and counter-strikes since a ceasefire in April, aimed at pausing the months-long war, fell apart in June.",
          "sentence_hash": "d05e6143464466db902d108de1e9b60ded9a2a0bd4dd1535cc6a3ccfa0091df3",
          "anchors": [
            "us"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "The US has blockaded Iranian ports and bombed Iranian sites, while Iran has fired missiles and drones at US assets in countries across the Middle East and targeted shipping in the economically important Strait of Hormuz, connecting the Gulf and Arabian Sea.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-31T08:03:13.958507+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "cf737f4f2dc114043f3f0bb257a119e3c88d5d9a2b9eef7408d7020bfe26633a",
          "excerpt": "The US has blockaded Iranian ports and bombed Iranian sites, while Iran has fired missiles and drones at US assets in countries across the Middle East and targeted shipping in the economically important Strait of Hormuz, connecting the Gulf and Arabian Sea.",
          "sentence_hash": "562d2e1d2e5afc97427e799607e58e0453611bdb97042382b7d564eb5920a69b",
          "anchors": [
            "all",
            "et"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "On Wednesday, news outlet Axios cited an unnamed US official as saying that Trump had met Saudi defence minister Prince Khalid bin Salman, who had conveyed that Saudi Arabia wants to de-escalate tensions.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-07-31T08:03:13.958540+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "cf737f4f2dc114043f3f0bb257a119e3c88d5d9a2b9eef7408d7020bfe26633a",
          "excerpt": "On Wednesday, news outlet Axios cited an unnamed US official as saying that Trump had met Saudi defence minister Prince Khalid bin Salman, who had conveyed that Saudi Arabia wants to de-escalate tensions.",
          "sentence_hash": "9c8d0ae0a5db5182e2e47f22a13644533d4581d85684a031bf0ceb0752045916",
          "anchors": [
            "et"
          ]
        }
      ],
